### Quick Start Script

```bash
# 1️⃣ Create repo
git init ecommerce-frontend
cd ecommerce-frontend

# 2️⃣ Scaffold Next.js + Tailwind
npx create-next-app@latest . --typescript
npm install -D tailwindcss postcss autoprefixer
npx tailwindcss init -p

# 3️⃣ Add Redux Toolkit
npm i @reduxjs/toolkit react-redux
npx tsc --init

# 4️⃣ Add Axios
npm i axios

# 5️⃣ Add testing libs
npm i -D jest @testing-library/react @testing-library/jest-dom @testing-library/user-event
npm i -D cypress

# 6️⃣ Add PWA plugin
npm i next-pwa

# 7️⃣ Add ESLint + Prettier
npm i -D eslint prettier eslint-config-prettier eslint-plugin-prettier

# 8️⃣ Commit & push to GitHub
git add .
git commit -m "Initial commit"
git remote add origin <repo-url>
git push -u origin main
```

From here, start building components, pages, and integrate your backend. Happy coding! 🚀
